Package: eversor
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Eversor contributors <arnavsx3@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Suggests: sudo
Homepage: https://github.com/arnavsx3/Eversor
Description: Inspect and clean supported caches and obsolete packages
 Eversor discovers supported application caches on Ubuntu and previews cleanup
 before asking for confirmation. Personal files and unknown directories are
 preserved. Optional system maintenance uses a narrowly scoped sudo helper.
